{title: Barish Wali Shaam}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Barish wali shaam ha[D]i, chai ka pyaala haath mein
[Em]Khidki pe boondein g[C]aati hain, tu nahin hai saath mein
[G]Purani diary khuli pad[D]i, tera naam har panne pe
[Em]Har ek lafz mein t[C]u hi tu, kya rakha [D]hai jeene mein
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]O mere humdum, laut [G]aa
[D]Yeh mausam bhi tujhe [Em]bulaaye
[C]O mere humdum, laut [G]aa
[D]Dil ab aur na sah paaye[G]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
[G]Galiyon mein paani bh[D]ar gaya, kaagaz ki kashti chal padi
[Em]Bachpan wali yaadein sa[C]ari, phir se aake mil padi
[G]Tu jo hota paas mere[D], hum bhi bheeg jaate saath
[Em]Ab toh bas yeh ba[C]adal hain aur a[D]dhoori si baat
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]O mere humdum, laut [G]aa
[D]Yeh mausam bhi tujhe [Em]bulaaye
[C]O mere humdum, laut [G]aa
[D]Dil ab aur na sah paaye[G]
{end_of_chorus}
